{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-H-projective-composition}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a1f62854e195c95eea2aa7f15d1da10870a5637c007f58f4d729b8022f63ef16", "source_text": "A composition of H-projective morphisms is H-projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9100d477c950a9389ffaed996aaa338471d166fd32a188e5db3bc0eeee7d6772", "unit_id": "tag:01WE:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$Y \\to Z$", "MATH_0003": "$X \\to \\mathbf{P}^n_Y$", "MATH_0004": "$Y$", "MATH_0005": "$Y \\to \\mathbf{P}^m_Z$", "MATH_0006": "$Z$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nX \\ar[r] \\ar[d] &\n\\mathbf{P}^n_Y \\ar[r] \\ar[dl] &\n\\mathbf{P}^n_{\\mathbf{P}^m_Z} \\ar[dl] \\ar@{=}[r] &\n\\mathbf{P}^n_Z \\times_Z \\mathbf{P}^m_Z \\ar[r] &\n\\mathbf{P}^{nm + n + m}_Z \\ar[ddllll] \\\\\nY \\ar[r] \\ar[d] & \\mathbf{P}^m_Z \\ar[dl] & \\\\\nZ & &\n}\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$X$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathbf{P}^{nm + n + m}_Z$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-segre-embedding}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:22917d0af26e6c67d0d4300db58aab37e7a37c95343d349e1139a29f20d9d0b1", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:66b20a46242d9e7eb802186802bbe30bf572cefaec916666601bb836776c76b9", "source_text": "Suppose <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> are H-projective.\nThen there exist closed immersions <MATH_0003>\nover <MATH_0004>, and <MATH_0005> over <MATH_0006>.\nConsider the following diagram\n<MATH_0007>\nHere the rightmost top horizontal arrow is the Segre embedding,\nsee Constructions, Lemma <REF_0001>.\nThe diagram identifies\n<MATH_0008> as a closed subscheme of <MATH_0009> as desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:76508f65b9906254ea4424454ff88be7fef51635091e3a126cbcb4dfac531104", "unit_id": "tag:01WE:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-H-projective-base-change}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6e1c83a8e1cc6777846f928fbed2caaf4895c06f3457f055eb526bc64d96ab0c", "source_text": "A base change of a H-projective morphism is H-projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1e25347f901894de8f55124d6609bccd7ac26703dc79d58a17d037e1e512743d", "unit_id": "tag:01WF:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-base-change-immersion}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:31305399ca6add2e919e0601412301920aebca992e6ba1d027a3528fc78b900f", "source_text": "This is true because the base change of projective space\nover a scheme is projective space, and the fact that the base\nchange of a closed immersion is a closed immersion, see\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:51d8b072a21ca760d4abf3ac44b400e5079730094e9c2db6950f02596771f6dc", "unit_id": "tag:01WF:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:dbc85102425a6e22d577578556f1568de6cb185330f8e652997e4efe5a20df2a", "source_text": "A base change of a (locally) projective morphism is (locally) projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:858ca19a99c47cc85ed4f8271e79dc37941622831e045431a3d03664681cef8d", "unit_id": "tag:02V6:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{modules-lemma-pullback-finite-type}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-base-change-immersion}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:329d559bd06077acab0ca13d14ea00c4977c01ff8d871fadd9f8e68c6ff386bd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:84f70e7a797f7c031b3aac14a1f140e53782782f4a9fbe9b3fc8f929b863e349", "source_text": "This is true because the base change of a projective bundle\nover a scheme is a projective bundle, the pullback of\na finite type <MATH_0001>-module is of finite type\n(Modules, Lemma <REF_0001>)\nand the fact that the base\nchange of a closed immersion is a closed immersion, see\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nSome details omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:00d0e06ec227705729d20632c0a257c98d4980297906964b0e6835f54df2b5c0", "unit_id": "tag:02V6:proof"}
